w: Joy- ful, joy- ful, we a- dore Thee, God of glor- y, Lord of love;
w: All Thy works with joy sur- round Thee, earth and heaven re- flect Thy rays,
w: Thou art giv- ing and for- giv- ing, ev- er bless- ing, ev- er blessed,
w: Mor- tals, join the ha- ppy chor- us, which the morn- ing stars be- gan;
